  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Archbishop Okoth Vocational Training Centre (VTC) Project Title: &apos;Smart Chicken Breeding Facility&apos;Project Objective: To promote social, economic and behavioural transformation of lives among targeted vulnerable members of Koru community Project Activities: Establishment of a Smart chicken breeding Facility (Site identification, recruitment, and facility construction, purchase of chicks, rearing and marketing to generate income. Income generated from chicken sale will be used to support beneficiaries basic needs and part of it ploughed back to sustain and scale up the project)</narrative>
